# Tech stack

Use Python 3.11+. Do not redesign or substitute these libraries without asking.

| Concern | Library | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| HTTP crawl | `httpx` (async) | |
| HTML parse | `beautifulsoup4` + `lxml` | `lxml` is the parser backend |
| Google Sheets | `gspread` + `google-auth` | Service-account auth; no raw Sheets HTTP |
| Telegram | `python-telegram-bot` | **`Bot` class only** |

## Telegram library rule

- Use low-level `Bot` methods (`get_updates`, `send_message`, etc.).
- Do **not** use `Application` / `ApplicationBuilder` or their polling/handler framework.
- Drive our own asyncio loop and offset/state persistence. PTB is for typed API calls and built-in flood-control retries only.
